    },
    {
        "text": "This is far enough. We're already at the wakemen camp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your sister roused me from my slumber. You could always return me to it with your own flames, if you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_carriagegoaway"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "A golden-haired Perro leaps off the back of a burdenbeast and rushes toward the red dragon."
    },
    {
        "text": "The burdenbeast is dragging an improvised cart with numerous long wooden boxes stacked upon it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Brigid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here? Are those\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Coffins?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$runsand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, coffins. Nemos said to bring 'em to the wakemen. Are they still in the ruins?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, is there someone with you? I can smell that same burning stink, and I could swear I heard you talking just now\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dead folks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "The type who'd pull their own arms out of their sockets to bite at their imaginary enemies if you grabbed their hand. Along with the poor wretches they tore to pieces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Theo. Nemos found him in the end. He...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's almost like this was the natural order of things. The bonfires will be burnin' brightest when night falls on Samhain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The red dragon looks towards Na Saoirs\u00ed, and sees a faint shadow in the distance, painting the silhouette of purple flames."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be out of coffins if this keeps up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
