    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope Brigid made it out of the city. And that the mist in the woods is thin enough for her to follow the trail...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blast it, Culann left a few unused weapons in his house. I can't let anyone see them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this fuel... explosives? Her Highness Loughshinny might find a use for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, what's the point when every servant in the citadel has already been afflicted by the purple flames? Besides, the greedy red dragon has already sent them away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Almost as if... she's preparing for a showdown with Her Highness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Or... setting a trap?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#5$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rory? What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1686_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're... Nemos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brooding Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm going through Culann's effects. If this isn't urgent, could I ask you to\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
