        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I still can't bring myself to kill them. Even if they might as well be dead already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha. Hahahah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd better drag this fellow back home. Could do without the unwanted attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
