    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-Don't mind me, I'll be on my way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that in your hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, nothing. Now, if you'll excuse me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That necklace. It was a gift from Niels to Emma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I gave her bread! That's way more valuable than jewelry in times like these! She gave it to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did she now? A necklace she never takes off?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1752_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-It's none of your business!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
