        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos? You stayed behind? I thought all the Dublinners left the city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me you're one of those living statues now, who refuse to move or talk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might be soon. Why did you bring them up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Samhain begins tonight. So I went through the houses of the missing people, and found plenty of good stuff for the party tonight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Samhain? Party?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "About Culann\u2014well, he was already on his last legs by then, and I didn't really...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not talk about that! Look at all this stuff! It'll be a night to remember!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman shows Nemos her bag, revealing a bottle of curded cystymilk, a few long-since-sprouted potatoes, and several bare bones."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1688_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just wait for me, Nemos, Culann... we'll have a fantastic Samhain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only when the woman has already disappeared around a corner does Nemos remember who she is: a villager who once lived on the outskirts of Na Saoirs\u00ed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Two years ago, the Victorians took her father away while investigating Dublinn. The autumn harvest had just ended, and she had been preparing to celebrate the harvest festival."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g5_remains_outside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What Loughshinny hears about the situation in the city exceeds her wildest imagination."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must go back. Now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait for me. I'll come with once I've delivered these folks to the wakemen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure about this, Brigid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's dangerous in the city. If I fail... there may be no survivors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "True, but I still gotta go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because it wasn't like this before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cityfolk never had much to spare, but they always had a cup of water for me when I delivered their letters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "They didn't see me as one of their own, but didn't walk away with a sneer when I told them nomad legends either. They listened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "And they <i>definitely</i> didn't bite, claw, and punch at people like they do these days. Like the walking dead straight from a story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who will the nomads deliver letters for, if the city dies for real?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g5_remains_outside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moran?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The second shipment of bodies has arrived from Na Saoirs\u00ed. I must make the preparations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this rate, it won't be long until the third, fourth, or more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we really going to ignore it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I've told you many times, the wakemen do not take sides. It is not our decision to make.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are the Na Saoirs\u00edans not Tarans too? Why are we standing on the side watching, when the Taran capital is marching towards destruction?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you came back with the red dragon. You fear she will meet the same fate as Labhr\u00e9athach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we were the ones to send Labhr\u00e9athach to his doom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are descended from the priests that once officiated the ceremonies of Tara's royal palace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our ancestors, moved by Labhr\u00e9athach's plea, welcomed him back into the palace when Ailill's stance was ambivalent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1691_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The flames of death that spread through the plains of Tara were only extinguished seven days after his death, when our ancestors finally returned his fire to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "text": "They then left the palace of their own accord, going into self-exile on Labhr\u00e9athach's former pastures, so as to never forget the lesson. And thus, the wakemen were born.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Wakewoman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Reed isn't Labhr\u00e9athach, and history is not a cycle that repeats itself endlessly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it were, Reed would have already died in that citadel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even her tyrant of a sister was the one to free Tara from Victorian rule.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fates are often alike, but always differ where it matters most.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
